ment exercé les fonctions de chef d’équipe du code bleu à l’Hôpital Douglas. Il a également formé du personnel en RCR, en premiers soins et en intervention lors d’urgences vitales. De plus, il a assuré la formation en réanimation cardiorespiratoire du personnel infirmier de l’Institut <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Philippe-Pinel</span> de Montréal.</p>","text_color":"#5B6780","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Source Sans 3","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[]},{"id":"b73d31e","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Infirmier praticien spécialisé (IPS), il possède également une expérience clinique en soins aigus à l’Hôpital général juif. Il a par ailleurs enseigné les soins infirmiers au Cégep <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\">André-Laurendeau</span>.</p>","text_color":"#5B6780","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Source Sans 3","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"d45a51f","elType":"container","isInner":true,"settings":{"flex_direction":"column","flex_gap":{"column":"18","row":"18","isLinked":true,"unit":"px","size":18},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"54b273a","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"Domaines d’expertise","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#0E1B33","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Montserrat","typography_font_weight":"800","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":26,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[]},{"id":"b4a3ae8","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Plusieurs années d’expérience en réanimation cardiorespiratoire, en formation clini